{"seq":2,"slug":"attribution-identity-stitching-mechanism","title":"归因窗口与跨端身份拼接机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/attribution-identity-stitching-mechanism","wordCount":2867,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"归因窗口与跨端身份拼接机制\">归因窗口与跨端身份拼接机制</h1><p>用户点了推荐链接、装了 App、下了单，中间可能隔了三台设备、两次登录、一次应用商店跳转——把这三件事认成&quot;同一个人经同一条邀请发生&quot;，就是归因。这里有两个彼此独立却必须联解的变量：<strong>窗口</strong>回答&quot;多久之内的行为还算这次邀请的功劳&quot;，<strong>拼接</strong>回答&quot;这两个信号是不是同一个人&quot;。窗口开得越宽召回越高但激励越容易被薅，拼接越激进匹配率越高但误合并越难回滚。工程上真正的难点不是选参数，而是让这两个决定可解释、可重放、可反作弊。本文聚焦归因裁定与身份拼接本身；推荐码如何生成、分享链接如何物化，见同章的 <a href=\"referral-code-link-generation-model\">推荐码与分享链接生成模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>归因裁定的输入是<strong>证据</strong>，输出是<strong>归属</strong>；窗口和拼接则是把证据变成归属的两把尺子。理解这一层后，最需要先纠正的一个误判是：把&quot;归因窗口&quot;当成一个参数。生产系统里至少有三种语义不同的时钟在跑，混用会导致奖励口径无法对齐：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时钟</th>\n<th>起止事件</th>\n<th>决定了什么</th>\n<th>典型取值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点击窗口（click window）</td>\n<td>点击邀请链接 → 注册/首单</td>\n<td>是否把这次转化记给邀请人</td>\n<td>移动端 1–7 天，Web 7–30 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>展示窗口（view window）</td>\n<td>看到物料 → 转化（无点击）</td>\n<td>未点击曝光能否计入</td>\n<td>1 天（移动端通常更短）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖励窗口（reward window）</td>\n<td>注册 → 满足奖励条件</td>\n<td>触发不好奖励、是否回收</td>\n<td>7–90 天，含退款回滚期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者必须分开存储与计算。点击窗口决定<strong>归因归属</strong>，奖励窗口决定<strong>结算时点</strong>——一个邀请可以归因成功却在奖励窗口内因退款被撤销。把二者压成一个字段，退款回滚时会连带抹掉归因事实，破坏审计链。</p>\n<p>时间衰减归因（time-decay attribution）是常见折中：给每个触点按距转化的时距分配权重，半衰期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 时第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个触点的权重为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i = \\frac{2^{-(t_{conv} - t_i)/h}}{\\sum_{j=1}^{n} 2^{-(t_{conv} - t_j)/h}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7209em;vertical-align:-1.1559em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.565em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2799em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8301em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0051em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1559em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在 MGM 场景里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 1–3 天：邀请是强意图行为，时距衰减快，靠后的自然流量不该分走功劳。归因归属判定本身则通常是 last-click 或 last-non-direct-click——把&quot;最后点击的非直接来源&quot;记给邀请，避免内部导航覆盖真实来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨端拼接要打穿四类断点\">跨端拼接要打穿四类断点</h2><p>从邀请人的分享到被邀请人的转化，身份信号会在四个位置断裂，每段丢失的参数不同、恢复手段也不同：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[邀请人在 App 生成链接&lt;br/&gt;携带邀请码 inviter_id] --&gt; B[分享到 IM&lt;br/&gt;预览抓取可能裁剪 query]&#10;  B --&gt; C[被邀请人点击&lt;br/&gt;落地页 302]&#10;  C --&gt; D{落地环境}&#10;  D --&gt;|同浏览器| E[Web 转化&lt;br/&gt;cookie/登录态可判定]&#10;  D --&gt;|未装 App| F[应用商店&lt;br/&gt;Install Referrer / 剪贴板 / pasteboard]&#10;  D --&gt;|已装 App| G[Universal/App Link&lt;br/&gt;带参唤起]&#10;  F --&gt; H[首启上报&lt;br/&gt;install 事件]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[拼接服务&lt;br/&gt;证据加权 → 归因裁定]&#10;  I --&gt; J[归因事实落库&lt;br/&gt;驱动奖励台账]\">graph TD\n  A[邀请人在 App 生成链接&lt;br/&gt;携带邀请码 inviter_id] --&gt; B[分享到 IM&lt;br/&gt;预览抓取可能裁剪 query]\n  B --&gt; C[被邀请人点击&lt;br/&gt;落地页 302]\n  C --&gt; D{落地环境}\n  D --&gt;|同浏览器| E[Web 转化&lt;br/&gt;cookie/登录态可判定]\n  D --&gt;|未装 App| F[应用商店&lt;br/&gt;Install Referrer / 剪贴板 / pasteboard]\n  D --&gt;|已装 App| G[Universal/App Link&lt;br/&gt;带参唤起]\n  F --&gt; H[首启上报&lt;br/&gt;install 事件]\n  G --&gt; H\n  E --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[拼接服务&lt;br/&gt;证据加权 → 归因裁定]\n  I --&gt; J[归因事实落库&lt;br/&gt;驱动奖励台账]</pre><p><strong>断点一：IM 预览抓取。</strong> 微信、Telegram 等会抓取链接生成预览卡片，部分裁剪查询串。因此不可丢失的身份参数应放在路径段而非 query（如 <code>/r/ABC123</code>），并可加一层服务端短链使其可重定向到渠道特定落地页。</p>\n<p><strong>断点二：Web → 应用商店跳转。</strong> 浏览器无法把 cookie 带进应用商店。这块由平台提供的确定性通道补齐：Android 的 <strong>Play Install Referrer</strong>（<code>com.android.vending.INSTALL_REFERRER</code> 广播/<code>InstallReferrerClient</code>）由 Google Play 在安装时透传来源参数（来源：Google Play Install Referrer Library，<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/google/play/installreferrer）；iOS\">https://developer.android.com/google/play/installreferrer）；iOS</a> 无对等能力，只能靠 <strong>SKAdNetwork/AdAttributionKit 回传</strong>或剪贴板方案。</p>\n<p><strong>断点三：应用商店 → 首启。</strong> 首启时被邀请人可能尚未登录。iOS 的剪贴板方案（<code>UIPasteboard</code> 读取）曾在业界广泛使用以传递深链，但因隐私合规争议与 iOS 16+ 的粘贴提示而被大量弃用，转向确定性更低但合规性更好的方案。</p>\n<p><strong>断点四：首启 → 登录。</strong> 只有登录后才把设备/安装 ID 与账户 ID 绑到同一个人。这一步是拼接图（identity graph）真正的合并点。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>背景事实：</strong> Firebase Dynamic Links 已于 2025 年 8 月 25 日停止服务（来源：Firebase Dynamic Links 弃用公告，<a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/docs/dynamic-links），大量依赖它做跨端深链与延迟深链的团队被迫迁移到自建短链\">https://firebase.google.com/docs/dynamic-links），大量依赖它做跨端深链与延迟深链的团队被迫迁移到自建短链</a> + 平台安装回调组合，这让&quot;自持归因通道&quot;从可选项变成必需项。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"确定性-概率-平台回传三条并行通道\">确定性、概率、平台回传三条并行通道</h2><p>拼接不是单一算法，而是三条证据强度递减的通道并行，最后按证据强度裁定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>证据来源</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th>覆盖率</th>\n<th>主要失效场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>确定性（deterministic）</td>\n<td>登录账户、邀请码直填、Universal Link 带参</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>覆盖已登录用户</td>\n<td>未登录首启</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率性（probabilistic）</td>\n<td>IP + User-Agent + 时区 + 设备指纹</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>可覆盖匿名</td>\n<td>误合并、隐私合规风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台回传（postback）</td>\n<td>SKAdNetwork / AdAttributionKit / ARA</td>\n<td>中（聚合/受控）</td>\n<td>仅安装事件</td>\n<td>无转化后行为明细</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>确定性通道</strong>是最该优先投资的。让被邀请人在注册时能填邀请码、让 Universal Link / App Link 直接带参唤起（Android App Links 走 <code>intent-filter</code> 的 <code>autoVerify</code>，iOS Universal Links 走 <code>apple-app-site-association</code>），这些不依赖任何平台回传，也不受 ATT 影响。</p>\n<p><strong>概率性通道</strong>的自变量（IP、UA、时区）本身是拿来&quot;猜&quot;的，在 GDPR/CCPA 与 ATT 语境下属高风险，误合并会产生&quot;张冠李戴&quot;的奖励。若使用，必须给每个证据分配<strong>时窗内有效性</strong>：IP 证据在移动网络下几分钟即失效，UA 在浏览器自动升级后失效，因此概率归因的窗口通常只有分钟级。</p>\n<p><strong>平台回传通道</strong>在 iOS 上是硬约束。<strong>App Tracking Transparency（ATT）</strong> 自 iOS 14.5 起要求跨应用追踪须获用户授权（来源：Apple，<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/app-store/user-privacy-and-data-use/），未授权则拿不到\">https://developer.apple.com/app-store/user-privacy-and-data-use/），未授权则拿不到</a> IDFA。<strong>SKAdNetwork</strong> 只回传聚合信号、无用户级明细；<strong>AdAttributionKit</strong> 在 WWDC 2024 引入，新增了 SKAdNetwork 缺失的**再互动归因（re-engagement）**能力，对&quot;已装 App 老用户被邀请回流&quot;这类 MGM 场景更有用（来源：Apple AdAttributionKit，<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/adattributionkit）。Android\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/adattributionkit）。Android</a> 侧的 <strong>Privacy Sandbox Attribution Reporting API</strong> 同样以聚合/受控方式回传（来源：Android Attribution Reporting，<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/design-for-safety/privacy-sandbox/attribution）。\">https://developer.android.com/design-for-safety/privacy-sandbox/attribution）。</a></p>\n<p>这三条通道的覆盖率与精度构成一个不可能三角，实践中按&quot;确定性优先、平台回传兜底、概率性慎用&quot;排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拼接图的证据加权与冲突消解\">拼接图的证据加权与冲突消解</h2><p>把每条证据看成带强度与时效的边，拼接即在这些边上求&quot;谁是同一个人&quot;的最大可信合并。一条证据的有效权重可建模为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(e, t) = S(e) \\cdot e^{-\\lambda \\Delta t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是证据类型的基础强度（登录态 ≫ 邀请码直填 ≫ 平台回传 ≫ 概率指纹），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是证据发生距当前的时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是该证据类型的衰减率。当两条边指向同一用户画像且合并冲突（如设备 D 同时被登录 A 与登录 B 认领）时，取累计权重更高者，并把另一方标记为<strong>待仲裁</strong>而非静默丢弃。</p>\n<p>冲突消解的三条硬规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>登录态优先于设备态。</strong> 一个设备可被多人使用，但账户通常唯一；设备级证据永远打不赢账户级证据。</li>\n<li><strong>近因优先于远因，但设下限。</strong> 30 天前的概率证据不应覆盖昨天的确定性证据。</li>\n<li><strong>合并可逆。</strong> 每次合并写入审计记录（证据、权重、裁定时间），允许因反作弊判定而拆分——否则一次误合并会永久污染两棵子树。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>在多触点归因下，一次转化的总奖励按触点权重分摊：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\sum_{i} w_i \\cdot v_i, \\quad \\sum_i w_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个触点的名义奖励值。MGM 通常只有邀请人一个触点，故 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>；但引入分享返利、二级邀请（老带新再带新）后，触点增多，权重必须显式定义，否则一级与二级奖励口径会漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地-可重放-可审计的拼接服务\">落地：可重放、可审计的拼接服务</h2><p>拼接服务的设计原则是&quot;<strong>先记录证据，后裁定归因</strong>&quot;，把不可变的原始信号与可变的裁定结果分开存储：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>事件层（append-only）：</strong> 点击、唤起、安装、注册、登录、下单各写一条带时间戳与来源的证据事件，永久保留（按数据最小化原则仅存拼接必需字段）。</li>\n<li><strong>裁定层（可重算）：</strong> 每份归因事实记录所用的规则版本、窗口参数、证据集合与裁定结果，使规则变更后可重放历史、解释&quot;为什么这单算给了 A 而不是 B&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等性：</strong> 安装回流、平台回传可能重复投递，拼接必须按 <code>(device_id, install_id)</code> 去重，重复事件不产生第二次归因。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>之所以强调可重放，是因为窗口参数会随业务调整（大促拉长窗口以冲量，风控收紧窗口以止损）。若归因结果不能基于原始证据重算，每次调参都是一次&quot;黑盒迁移&quot;，历史奖励无法复盘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"窗口与拼接共同划定反作弊的边界\">窗口与拼接共同划定反作弊的边界</h2><p>反作弊与归因是一体两面：<strong>窗口越宽、拼接越激进，可被解释为&quot;邀请&quot;的行为集就越大</strong>。常见的三对张力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>窗口过宽</strong> → 用户一年前的自然流量被记成邀请，激励超发。缓解：注册事件与首单事件分别设窗，首单窗口显著短于注册窗口。</li>\n<li><strong>概率拼接过度</strong> → 同一 Wi-Fi（宿舍、办公室）下的多人被合并成一人，一人一码的自邀被放大。缓解：概率证据只用于&quot;候选提示&quot;不作为&quot;裁定依据&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>自邀（self-referral）</strong> → 同一人在多个设备/账户间互邀。缓解：拼接图在裁定前先跑<strong>设备-账户-支付工具</strong>三重相似度检查（详见反作弊章节）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个可操作的护栏是给归因事实附加<strong>置信度</strong>而非二元判定：确定性通道命中记 <code>confidence=1.0</code>，平台回传记 <code>0.7</code>，概率拼接记 <code>0.3</code> 并进入人工/规则复核队列。奖励结算按置信度分档——高置信度即时发放，中置信度延迟至奖励窗口结束，低置信度暂缓并抽检。这样窗口与拼接的参数调整不再直接等于&quot;多发钱&quot;或&quot;少发钱&quot;，而是转移了风险的承担位置，让风控与增长能分开调参、各自可回滚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>窗口与拼接是同一套裁定逻辑的两个变量：窗口划定&quot;什么算数&quot;的时间边界，拼接划定&quot;谁是同一个人&quot;的身份边界。工程落地的关键不是把二者调到最优，而是：把归因证据与裁定结果分层存储、让每次裁定可重放、给归因事实附加置信度而非二元判定，从而让增长与风控能各自调参、各自回滚。确定性通道永远优先，平台回传兜底，概率拼接只作候选。</p>\n<p><strong>同章延伸：</strong> <a href=\"referral-code-link-generation-model\">推荐码与分享链接生成模型</a> 讲清了身份载体如何生成与物化，本篇讲清了这些载体落地后如何被裁定归属；两篇共同构成&quot;推荐码、归因与生命周期&quot;的完整链路。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"归因窗口与跨端身份拼接机制","id":"归因窗口与跨端身份拼接机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"跨端拼接要打穿四类断点","id":"跨端拼接要打穿四类断点"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性、概率、平台回传三条并行通道","id":"确定性-概率-平台回传三条并行通道"},{"level":2,"text":"拼接图的证据加权与冲突消解","id":"拼接图的证据加权与冲突消解"},{"level":2,"text":"落地：可重放、可审计的拼接服务","id":"落地-可重放-可审计的拼接服务"},{"level":2,"text":"窗口与拼接共同划定反作弊的边界","id":"窗口与拼接共同划定反作弊的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推荐码与分享链接生成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/referral-code-link-generation-model"},"next":{"title":"推荐关系生命周期与失效撤销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/referral-relation-lifecycle-expiry"}}